flowchart TD
  subgraph Corporate["Corporate IT zone (Level 4-5)"]
    IT[Corporate IT Network]
  end
  subgraph Supervisory["Supervisory control zone (Level 2-3)"]
    EWS[Engineering Workstation]
    HMI[HMI]
    SCADA[SCADA Server]
    Historian[(Historian)]
  end
  subgraph Field["Field control zone (Level 0-1)"]
    PLC[PLC]
    Pump((Chlorine Dosing Pump))
    Sensor((Level Sensor))
  end
  IT -->|occasional maintenance connection| EWS
  IT -->|reporting queries| Historian
  EWS -->|PLC programming| SCADA
  HMI -->|operator commands| SCADA
  SCADA -->|Modbus/TCP| PLC
  SCADA -->|historize telemetry| Historian
  PLC -->|actuate| Pump
  Sensor -->|level reading| PLC
